# (1.4.0, the user's) the knobs without their numbers: a ring's number shown a moment as a page opens (the peek), then
# gone (the ring says it; the big ring gives it while a knob turns); Setup's second page, KNOB 2, Values: Peek or
# Always (global, saved, as Lights)
listen
wait 1500
expect values 0
tap ENV
wait 200
expect peek 1
wait 2000
expect peek 0
tap ENV
wait 200
expect peek 1
wait 2000
expect peek 0
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 28
said Song mode page: Mode Endless, Transition LP, only in Set mode, Grid Off, Values Peek
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Values Always
expect values 1
expect peek 1
tap ENV
wait 2500
expect peek 1
# kept by a save, a reboot
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
reboot
wait 1000
expect values 1
expect peek 1
tap GLO
wait 200
tap GLO
wait 400
spin K4 -1
wait 300
said Values Peek
expect values 0
tap ENV
wait 2500
expect peek 0
